* Task 16 fixture: malformed statements in data-access extraction
* Deliberately includes malformed lines (READ with no target, broken DEFINE WORK FILE)
* to prove extraction degrades gracefully: parser emits diagnostics for malformed lines,
* extraction skips them, but valid edges/definitions are still produced.
* Channel separation: diagnostics and extraction stay separate.

DEFINE DATA
LOCAL
  1 #VALID-FIELD (N5)
  1 #ANOTHER (A20)
END-DEFINE

* Valid READ
READ EMPLOYEES

* Malformed READ (no target) — parser emits diagnostic, extractor skips
READ

* Valid STORE
STORE EMPLOYEES

* Malformed DEFINE WORK FILE (no file number) — parser diagnostic
DEFINE WORK FILE 'NO-NUMBER'

* Valid FIND
FIND VEHICLES

WRITE 'End'

END
